<</T (at the height of the COVID-19 pandemic, Minister Budi took office with an immediate mandate to bring the health crisis under control and accelerate Indonesias vaccination programme. His response combined vaccine diplomacy and procurement, rapid expansion of vaccination capacity, strengthened surveillance and treatment, and close coordination across government, health workers, communities and international partners.)
/Type /StructElem
/P 156 0 R
