365 0 obj
<</T (Under Minister Budis leadership, Indonesia has placed primary health care at the centre of its Health Transformation Agenda, shifting the system from treating illness to keeping people healthy. Through Integrated Primary Care \(ILP\), services are being reorganised around peoples needs across the life course, bringing prevention, early detection and essential care closer to communities. This transformation is strengthening a nationwide network of more than 10,000 primary health centres and over 300,000 community health posts, expanding the foundations for more equitable access to quality care.)
/Type /StructElem
/P 158 0 R
/S /H3
/E (Under Minister Budis leadership, Indonesia has placed primary health care at the centre of its Health Transformation Agenda, shifting the system from treating illness to keeping people healthy. Through Integrated Primary Care \(ILP\), services are being reorganised around peoples needs across the life course, bringing prevention, early detection and essential care closer to communities. This transformation is strengthening a nationwide network of more than 10,000 primary health centres and over 300,000 community health posts, expanding the foundations for more equitable access to quality care.)
/K [3]
/Pg 19 0 R
>>
endobj
366 0 obj
<</T (This preventive approach is now being brought to national scale through Cek Kesehatan Gratis \(CKG\), Indonesias free annual health screening programme. Launched in 2025 and delivered through primary health facilities, schools and communities, CKG reached 100 million people within its first 15 months and aims to cover 280 million people by 2029. )
/Type /StructElem
/P 158 0 R
/S /H3
/E (This preventive approach is now being brought to national scale through Cek Kesehatan Gratis \(CKG\), Indonesias free annual health screening programme. Launched in 2025 and delivered through primary health facilities, schools and communities, CKG reached 100 million people within its first 15 months and aims to cover 280 million people by 2029. )
/K [4]
/Pg 19 0 R
>>
