<</T (At the Gates Foundations 2025 Goalkeepers event, during a conversation on advancing childhood immunisation and primary health care, Minister Budi reflected on how vaccines shaped his own life. When he was born in 1964, one in seven Indonesian babies did not survive their first birthday. Vaccination gave him the chance to grow up, study physics, build a career and eventually serve as Indonesias Minister of Health.)
/Type /StructElem
/P 165 0 R
/S /H3
/E (At the Gates Foundations 2025 Goalkeepers event, during a conversation on advancing childhood immunisation and primary health care, Minister Budi reflected on how vaccines shaped his own life. When he was born in 1964, one in seven Indonesian babies did not survive their first birthday. Vaccination gave him the chance to grow up, study physics, build a career and eventually serve as Indonesias Minister of Health.)
/K [3]
/Pg 26 0 R
>>
endobj
