<</T (He described how Indonesia turned its COVID-19 vaccination response into a platform for longer-term health reform. Since 2022, Indonesia has added HPV, pneumococcal and rotavirus vaccines to its national programme, while strengthening primary care to detect pregnancy risks and chronic diseases earlier.)
