/E (Minister Budi Gunadi Sadikin has dedicated his leadership and public service to advancing equitable, resilient, and sustainable health systems. As Minister of Health, he has led an ambitious national health transformation agenda, focused on strengthening primary health care, advancing universal health coverage, expanding access to quality health services, accelerating digital health innovation, enhancing preparedness for future health emergencies, and promoting equitable access to medicines, vaccines and health technologies.)
